Source: xpmem-kmod
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ucx-group@elist.ornl.gov
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10)
Standards-Version: 4.4.1
Section: kernel
Homepage: https://github.com/openucx/xpmem/

Package: xpmem-modules
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: XPMEM kernel module
 XPMEM is a Linux kernel module that enables a process to map the
 memory of another process into its virtual address space.
 .
 This package provides the compiled kernel module. Build with KVERS
 set to the target kernel version (e.g., KVERS=5.15.0-91-generic).
